<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu eases to 4.6045 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu eases to 4.6045 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.6045 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6035 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					 Oct 3		   Oct 2</p>
<p>    lei per dollar		 4.6045		  4.6035</p>
<p>    volume traded ($)	    30,000		  30,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
